{"id":3271,"slug":"3271-configmodule-va-configservice-trong-nestjs-hoat-dong-nhu-the-nao","category":"NestJS","subcategory":"Testing & Production","level":"beginner","question_vi":"ConfigModule và ConfigService trong NestJS hoạt động như thế nào?","question_en":"How do ConfigModule and ConfigService work in NestJS?","answer_vi":"`@nestjs/config` giúp quản lý environment variables an toàn với type-safety. `ConfigModule.forRoot()` với `isGlobal: true` cho phép inject `ConfigService` ở bất kỳ module nào mà không cần import lại.\n\nValidation schema với Joi: `validationSchema: Joi.object({ PORT: Joi.number().default(3000), JWT_SECRET: Joi.string().min(32).required() })` — app sẽ fail ngay khi start nếu env vars thiếu hoặc sai format.\n\nNamespaced config với `registerAs('database', () => ({ host: process.env.DB_HOST, port: parseInt(process.env.DB_PORT) }))` cho phép nhóm config và inject type-safe qua `@Inject(databaseConfig.KEY) private dbConfig: ConfigType<typeof databaseConfig>`. `ConfigService.get<string>('KEY')` dùng khi không cần namespace, `ConfigService.get<string>('database.host')` với dot notation cho nested config.","answer_en":"`@nestjs/config` helps manage environment variables safely with type-safety. `ConfigModule.forRoot()` with `isGlobal: true` allows injecting `ConfigService` in any module without re-importing.\n\nValidation schema with Joi: `validationSchema: Joi.object({ PORT: Joi.number().default(3000), JWT_SECRET: Joi.string().min(32).required() })` — the app fails immediately on startup if env vars are missing or malformed.\n\nNamespaced config with `registerAs('database', () => ({ host: process.env.DB_HOST, port: parseInt(process.env.DB_PORT) }))` groups config and allows type-safe injection via `@Inject(databaseConfig.KEY) private dbConfig: ConfigType<typeof databaseConfig>`. Use `ConfigService.get<string>('KEY')` without namespace, or `ConfigService.get<string>('database.host')` with dot notation for nested config.","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\"><code>@nestjs/config</code> giúp quản lý environment variables an toàn với type-safety. <code>ConfigModule.forRoot()</code> với <code>isGlobal: true</code> cho phép inject <code>ConfigService</code> ở bất kỳ module nào mà không cần import lại.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Validation schema với Joi: <span class=\"qa-code-wrap qa-code-wrap--soft qa-code-wrap--inline\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"validationSchema: Joi.object({ PORT: Joi.number().default(3000), JWT_SECRET: Joi.string().min(32).required() })\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><span class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">validationSchema: Joi.<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">object</span>({ PORT: Joi.<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>().<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">default</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">3000</span>), JWT_SECRET: Joi.<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>().<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">min</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">32</span>).<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">required</span>() })</code></span></span> — app sẽ fail ngay khi start nếu env vars thiếu hoặc sai format.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Namespaced config với <span class=\"qa-code-wrap qa-code-wrap--soft qa-code-wrap--inline\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"registerAs('database', () =&gt; ({ host: process.env.DB_HOST, port: parseInt(process.env.DB_PORT) }))\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><span class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-title function_\">registerAs</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;database&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> ({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">host</span>: process.<span class=\"hljs-property\">env</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">DB_HOST</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">port</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">parseInt</span>(process.<span class=\"hljs-property\">env</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">DB_PORT</span>) }))</code></span></span> cho phép nhóm config và inject type-safe qua <span class=\"qa-code-wrap qa-code-wrap--soft qa-code-wrap--inline\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"@Inject(databaseConfig.KEY) private dbConfig: ConfigType&lt;typeof databaseConfig&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><span class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Inject</span>(databaseConfig.<span class=\"hljs-property\">KEY</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">dbConfig</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ConfigType</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> databaseConfig&gt;</code></span></span>. <code>ConfigService.get&lt;string&gt;('KEY')</code> dùng khi không cần namespace, <code>ConfigService.get&lt;string&gt;('database.host')</code> với dot notation cho nested config.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\"><code>@nestjs/config</code> helps manage environment variables safely with type-safety. <code>ConfigModule.forRoot()</code> with <code>isGlobal: true</code> allows injecting <code>ConfigService</code> in any module without re-importing.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Validation schema with Joi: <span class=\"qa-code-wrap qa-code-wrap--soft qa-code-wrap--inline\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"validationSchema: Joi.object({ PORT: Joi.number().default(3000), JWT_SECRET: Joi.string().min(32).required() })\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><span class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">validationSchema: Joi.<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">object</span>({ PORT: Joi.<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>().<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">default</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">3000</span>), JWT_SECRET: Joi.<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>().<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">min</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">32</span>).<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">required</span>() })</code></span></span> — the app fails immediately on startup if env vars are missing or malformed.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Namespaced config with <span class=\"qa-code-wrap qa-code-wrap--soft qa-code-wrap--inline\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"registerAs('database', () =&gt; ({ host: process.env.DB_HOST, port: parseInt(process.env.DB_PORT) }))\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><span class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-title function_\">registerAs</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;database&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> ({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">host</span>: process.<span class=\"hljs-property\">env</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">DB_HOST</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">port</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">parseInt</span>(process.<span class=\"hljs-property\">env</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">DB_PORT</span>) }))</code></span></span> groups config and allows type-safe injection via <span class=\"qa-code-wrap qa-code-wrap--soft qa-code-wrap--inline\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"@Inject(databaseConfig.KEY) private dbConfig: ConfigType&lt;typeof databaseConfig&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><span class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">@Inject</span>(databaseConfig.<span class=\"hljs-property\">KEY</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">dbConfig</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ConfigType</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> databaseConfig&gt;</code></span></span>. Use <code>ConfigService.get&lt;string&gt;('KEY')</code> without namespace, or <code>ConfigService.get&lt;string&gt;('database.host')</code> with dot notation for nested config.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3272-cach-viet-unit-tests-va-integration-tests-trong-nestjs","title":"Cách viết unit tests và integration tests trong NestJS?"},{"url":"/q/3278-toi-uu-performance-nestjs-fastify-caching-compression-rate-limiting","title":"Tối ưu performance NestJS: Fastify, Caching, Compression, Rate Limiting?"},{"url":"/q/3280-swagger-openapi-documentation-trong-nestjs-setup-va-cac-annotations-pho-bien","title":"Swagger / OpenAPI documentation trong NestJS — setup và các annotations phổ biến?"},{"url":"/q/3260-nestjs-la-gi-tai-sao-nen-dung-nestjs-thay-vi-express-thuan","title":"NestJS là gì? Tại sao nên dùng NestJS thay vì Express thuần?"},{"url":"/q/3261-module-trong-nestjs-la-gi-giai-thich-cau-truc-module-decorator","title":"Module trong NestJS là gì? Giải thích cấu trúc @Module decorator."},{"url":"/q/3262-controller-trong-nestjs-lam-gi-cach-dinh-nghia-routes-voi-decorators","title":"Controller trong NestJS làm gì? Cách định nghĩa routes với decorators?"},{"url":"/q/3263-provider-va-dependency-injection-trong-nestjs-hoat-dong-nhu-the-nao","title":"Provider và Dependency Injection trong NestJS hoạt động như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3264-giai-thich-request-lifecycle-trong-nestjs-middleware-guards-interceptors-pipes-c","title":"Giải thích Request Lifecycle trong NestJS: Middleware → Guards → Interceptors → Pipes → Controller → Exception Filters."}]}